{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Retro Arcade Golf, Reimagined</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/342d5f8115222c9166a8e367e5188caf.poster.avif?t=1774462374\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/342d5f8115222c9166a8e367e5188caf.webm?t=1774462374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/342d5f8115222c9166a8e367e5188caf.mp4?t=1774462374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic 18\u2011hole gameplay and develop your skills as you climb to stardom across Golf 5 MAX\u2019s beautiful courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of characters with unique skillsets and big personalities, and upgrade various stats to train the perfect golfer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/7d4e7ae8736760aa629e336446c0718e.poster.avif?t=1774462374\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/7d4e7ae8736760aa629e336446c0718e.webm?t=1774462374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/7d4e7ae8736760aa629e336446c0718e.mp4?t=1774462374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase <strong>Power </strong>for longer shot distances, <strong>Technique</strong> to build more sidespin, <strong>Consistency</strong> and <strong>Focus</strong> to slow shot meters, and<strong> Putting</strong> to upgrade visuals on the green.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf 5 MAX launches in Early Access, giving players a fully playable first look packed with hours of fun. Over the coming weeks, we\u2019ll be rolling out a complete set of upgrades, including new courses, new characters, more game modes and many more features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/4bf616afef4d3ac46da09e79ec34f8e0.poster.avif?t=1774462374\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/4bf616afef4d3ac46da09e79ec34f8e0.webm?t=1774462374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/extras/4bf616afef4d3ac46da09e79ec34f8e0.mp4?t=1774462374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge rivals in online multiplayer sessions for up to four players, with several game modes to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks against golfers around the world in <strong>official International eGolf Federation tournaments</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with precision and real\u2011world ball\u2011flight mechanics powered by Golf 5\u2019s award\u2011winning physics engine.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929380?t=1774462374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/a83d32ae5144fd61002fa935359d5147460fd59a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774462374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3