rnaments</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with precision and real\u2011world ball\u2011flight mechanics powered by Golf 5\u2019s award\u2011winning physics engine.</p></li></ul>","developers":["AAA Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929380/de4d45c15bd8489f350abb49995ee47ea1ece3bc/header.jpg?t=1774462374","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929380/1246437975/3c0a878239a4d646248c5f0f861eabed2f1abda6/1765285095/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765286143","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929380/1246437975/3c0a878239a4d646248c5f0f861eabed2f1abda6/1765285095/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765286143","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929380/1246437975/3c0a878239a4d646248c5f0f861eabed2f1abda6/1765285095/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765286143","id":257245765,"name":"Golf 5 MAX - 80s Commercial Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257245765/8c9a814b5f72c43952e26dec79b497616cabaf18/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765286143"}],"name":"Golf 5 MAX","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5 o equivalente<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["AAA Game Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":